 "body": "## Wave 1.2 — SEC-2 regression guard (master prompt §1.2)\n\nAdds `tests/security/test_env_files_no_token_shapes.py`: sweeps tracked `.env*` files for token **shapes** (ghp_ / gh[osu]_ / github_pat_ / hf_ / telegram-bot) with structural placeholder templates (fullmatch — safe against real tokens containing `xxxxx` runs).\n\n**Evidence**\n| Gate | Result |\n|---|---|\n| Clean tree | 5 passed |\n| Negative control (`git add -f .env.probe` w/ ghp_-shape) | 1 failed, gate works |\n| Clean re-check | 5 passed |\n\nSuite env files are currently clean (values are `CHANGE_ME_*` / empty) — this is a preventive gate, not a fix. Whole-tree/full-history coverage = Wave 1.1 scan.",
